@startuml
skinparam componentStyle uml2

actor "Clients\n(Web/Mobile)" as Client
node "CanBankX Monolith\n(Go / REST API)" as Monolith
database "MySQL\nDatabase" as DB

Client --> Monolith : HTTPS / REST
Monolith --> DB : TCP Connection

node "Observability Stack" {
  component "Prometheus" as Prom
  component "Grafana" as Grafana
  component "Structured Logs\n(e.g., stdout/file)" as Logs
}

Monolith -.-> Prom : Exposes Metrics (/metrics)
Monolith -.-> Logs : Writes Logs
Grafana --> Prom : Queries Metrics
@enduml
